    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "When [`isVideoMaxFrameDurationSupported`](avcaptureconnection/isvideomaxframedurationsupported.md) is [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), the value of the property configures the upper bound for the amount of time a video connection separates consecutive frames.",
      "ko": "Retrieve the underlying error from the notification’s user information dictionary using the key [`AVCaptureSessionErrorKey`](avcapturesessionerrorkey.md).",
      "sourceHash": "6a2ffe74e898ff126b613c0cfa911ff385e9d8ed8eda65b7c512e9ab25836a37",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "The value is equivalent to the reciprocal of the minimum frame rate.",
      "ko": "See the [`isPortraitEffectEnabled`](avcapturedevice/isportraiteffectenabled.md) property of [`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md) for more information.",
      "sourceHash": "9e9f62fba811a7084670a3e1516a83befea82f3fe056a7876312f5d65567d706",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "You can set an unlimited frame rate with [`zero`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/zero) or [`invalid`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/invalid) (which is the default).",
      "ko": "This property only takes effect when [`isCinematicVideoCaptureEnabled`](avcapturedeviceinput/iscinematicvideocaptureenabled.md) is set to `true`.",
      "sourceHash": "ec136961a200bd6870eddda334cd93c12680a552fffa026ebf8bdd0933d08770",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
